text: ['{TK}{TK} — Afflict 2 (Whenever this creature becomes blocked, defending player loses 2 life.)\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — Flying\n{TK}{TK} — 1/4\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 8/6', '{TK}{TK} — Bushido 2 (Whenever this creature blocks or becomes blocked, it gets +2/+2 until end of turn.)\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — Double strike\n{TK}{TK} — 2/4\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 5/6', '{TK}{TK} — Deathtouch\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, create that many 1/1 green Squirrel creature tokens.\n{TK}{TK} — 5/1\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 3/6', '{TK}{TK} — Exalted, exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each instance of exalted among permanents you control.)\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked only by creatures with shadow.)\n{TK}{TK} — 1/5\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 7/4', '{TK}{TK} — Exile this permanent: You may cast target nonland card from your graveyard this turn.\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — Whenever a creature you control dies, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.\n{TK}{TK} — 1/5\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 5/4', '{TK}{TK} — First strike\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, draw that many cards.\n{TK}{TK} — 3/3\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 6/2', '{TK}{TK} — Haste\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying 2 life in addition to paying its other costs.\n{TK}{TK} — 1/4\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 5/3', '{TK}{TK} — Hellbent — This creature gets +3/+3 as long as you have no cards in hand.\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — {2}, Sacrifice this creature: It deals X damage divided as you choose among any number of target creatures, where X is its power.\n{TK}{TK} — 1/5\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 6/3', '{TK}{TK} — Heroic — Whenever you cast a spell that targets this permanent, put two +1/+1 counters on it.\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — Protection from even mana values\n{TK}{TK} — 2/3\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 7/8', '{TK}{TK} — Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on this permanent.\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — Whenever a creature blocks this creature, that creature gets -4/-4 until end of turn.\n{TK}{TK} — 4/1\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 3/5', '{TK}{TK} — Lifelink\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — This creature must be blocked if able. Whenever this creature becomes blocked, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each creature blocking it.\n{TK}{TK} — 1/4\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 6/8', "{TK}{TK} — Menace\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — Persist (When this permanent dies, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)\n{TK}{TK} — 2/3\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 10/10", '{TK}{TK} — Mentor (Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power.)\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — When this permanent leaves the battlefield, you may destroy target creature with power 4 or greater.\n{TK}{TK} — 2/3\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 8/4', '{TK}{TK} — Outlast {1} ({1}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on this creature. Outlast only as a sorcery.)\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — When this permanent dies, you get seven {TK}.\n{TK}{TK} — 1/4\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 9/6', '{TK}{TK} — Prowess, prowess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn twice.)\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — {2}, {T}: This permanent deals 2 damage to any target.\n{TK}{TK} — 4/2\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 4/8', '{TK}{TK} — Sacrifice this permanent: Draw two cards.\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — Whenever this creature attacks, proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)\n{TK}{TK} — 4/1\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 8/7', "{TK}{TK} — Skulk (This creature can't be blocked by creatures with greater power.)\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — Battle cry (Whenever this creature attacks, each other attacking creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.)\n{TK}{TK} — 3/2\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 6/8", "{TK}{TK} — Trample\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — {3}: Monstrosity 3. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put three +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous.)\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 2/7\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 6/5", '{TK}{TK} — Vigilance\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — {1}, {T}: Tap target creature.\n{TK}{TK} — 1/5\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 5/4', '{TK}{TK} — Ward {2} (Whenever this creature becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, counter it unless that player pays {2}.)\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — Provoke (Whenever this creature attacks, you may have target creature defending player controls untap and block it if able.)\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 5/3\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 7/7', '{TK}{TK} — When this permanent dies, return target noncreature, nonland card from your graveyard to your hand.\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, that player mills twice that many cards.\n{TK}{TK} — 2/3\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 7/2', '{TK}{TK} — When this permanent leaves the battlefield, create two Food tokens. (They\'re artifacts with "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: You gain 3 life.")\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — When this permanent dies, destroy target nonland permanent.\n{TK}{TK} — 3/3\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 6/2', '{TK}{TK} — When this permanent leaves the battlefield, draw a card.\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, this permanent becomes a 13/13 Eldrazi creature in addition to its other types until end of turn.\n{TK}{TK} — 4/2\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 5/6', '{TK}{TK} — When this permanent leaves the battlefield, target player discards a card.\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — When this permanent leaves the battlefield, create five 1/1 white Clown Robot artifact creature tokens.\n{TK}{TK} — 3/3\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 6/5', '{TK}{TK} — Whenever this creature attacks, bolster 1. (Choose a creature with the least toughness among creatures you control and put a +1/+1 counter on it.)\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — Indestructible\n{TK}{TK} — 3/2\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 5/4', '{TK}{TK} — Whenever this creature attacks, create a Treasure token.\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — {3}: Target creature gains flying until end of turn.\n{TK}{TK} — 3/2\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 10/10', '{TK}{TK} — Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on it.\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — Metalcraft — This permanent has protection from noncreature permanents as long as you control three or more artifacts.\n{TK}{TK} — 5/1\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 7/4', '{TK}{TK} — Whenever this creature attacks, scry 1.\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — Whenever this permanent leaves the battlefield, you may destroy target artifact or enchantment.\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 4/5\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 8/4', '{TK}{TK} — Whenever this creature attacks, untap target permanent.\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.\n{TK}{TK} — 2/3\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 5/3', '{TK}{TK} — Whenever this creature attacks, you gain 2 life.\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — Vigilance, reach\n{TK}{TK} — 2/4\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 7/7', "{TK}{TK} — Whenever this creature attacks, you get {TK}.\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — Undying (When this creature dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)\n{TK}{TK} — 4/2\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 6/9", "{TK}{TK} — Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, exile target creature you control, then return it to the battlefield under it owner's control.\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — {T}: Untap another target permanent.\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 4/4\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 7/8", "{TK}{TK} — Whenever this permanent dies, you may return target creature to its owner's hand.\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — Whenever this creature attacks, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.\n{TK}{TK} — 3/3\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 2/6", "{TK}{TK} — Whenever you cast a spell, this creature gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the amount of generic mana in that spell's mana cost.\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — Hexproof\n{TK}{TK} — 4/2\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 6/6", "{TK}{TK} — {1}: Switch this creature's power and toughness until end of turn.\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — Whenever this creature attacks, it gets +5/+5 until end of turn.\n{TK}{TK} — 3/2\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 2/7", "{TK}{TK} — {1}: Target creature can't block this creature this turn.\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — Morbid — At the beginning of each end step, if a creature died this turn and this permanent is a creature, put a -1/-1 counter on this permanent and draw a card.\n{TK}{TK} — 2/4\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 7/2", '{TK}{TK} — {1}: Target creature gains all creature types until end of turn.\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — Magecraft — Whenever you cast or copy an instant or sorcery spell, draw a card.\n{TK}{TK} — 2/4\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 8/7', "{TK}{TK} — {1}: This creature gets +1/-1 until end of turn.\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — When this creature dies, you may put X +1/+1 counters on target creature, where X is this creature's power.\n{TK}{TK} — 5/1\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 4/7", '{TK}{TK} — {2}: This creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn.\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, this permanent deals 2 damage to target player.\n{TK}{TK} — 4/1\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 3/6', '{TK}{TK} — {5}: Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — Protection from creatures with two or more creature types\n{TK}{TK} — 3/3\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 9/6', "{TK}{TK} — {T}: Add one mana of any color.\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — Whenever this creature attacks, if it's not a Brushwagg, it gets +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is the number of supertypes, card types, and subtypes it has.\n{TK}{TK} — 5/1\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 4/8", '{TK}{TK} — {T}: Add {2}. Spend this mana only to cast creature spells.\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — At the beginning of combat on your turn, target noncreature artifact you control becomes a 4/4 artifact creature with flying until end of turn.\n{TK}{TK} — 2/4\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 8/6', '{TK}{TK} — {T}: Add {C}{C}. Spend this mana only to cast noncreature spells.\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — Infect (This permanent deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)\n{TK}{TK} — 3/2\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 4/7', '{TK}{TK} — {T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — Whenever this creature attacks, you gain 3 life and draw a card.\n{TK}{TK} — 1/5\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 4/4', '{TK}{TK} — {T}: Exile target card from a graveyard.\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — Threshold — As long as seven or more cards are in your graveyard, this creature gets +4/+0 and has trample.\n{TK}{TK} — 4/2\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 6/9', '{TK}{TK} — {T}: Target creature gains haste until end of turn.\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — Deathtouch, lifelink\n{TK}{TK} — 5/1\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 3/5', '{TK}{TK} — {T}: The next time target player would roll one or more dice this turn, instead they roll that many dice plus one, then you choose one of those rolls to ignore.\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — Protection from odd mana values\n{TK}{TK} — 4/1\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — 6/6', '{TK}{TK} — {T}: You gain 1 life.\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} — Whenever this creature attacks, tap each creature an opponent controls with the same power and/or same toughness as this creature.\n{TK}{TK} — 4/1\n{TK}{TK}{TK} — 2/6']
